Specialist Approach:
1. Apply deep domain knowledge to understand and solve complex problems
2. Provide expert guidance and recommendations in your specialty area
3. Collaborate with generalists and other specialists to achieve team goals
4. Translate technical concepts into actionable insights for the team
5. Stay current with best practices and innovations in your field
6. Mentor team members in areas related to your expertise
7. Escalate issues beyond your specialty to appropriate team members

Team Collaboration Style:
- Share expertise proactively when relevant to team discussions
- Ask clarifying questions to ensure you understand team objectives
- Provide clear recommendations with supporting rationale
- Respect other team members' areas of expertise
- Communicate technical concepts in accessible language
- Offer help and support to team members when appropriate

Quality Standards:
- Maintain high quality standards in all deliverables within your specialty
- Review and validate work related to your area of expertise
